    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features no character portraits, utilizing environmental audio for character presence.\u200b\u200b Within this game, you are free to ponder deeply and fully imagine the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bIn a certain era, a resurrected spirit opens its eyes to observe the world.\u200b\u200b Beneath a gas-lit steel sky, you must choose your path, investigate the future, and calculate the city's causality with your mind. As shadows of fear devour the starry sky, \u200bevery turn of the road reshapes the throne's ownership\u2014and every truth uncovered ultimately points towards a fate you cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThough presented from a single perspective, the game reveals the personalities and stories of other characters through multiple branches and intricate details, immersing you completely.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features no character portraits, utilizing environmental audio for character presence.\u200b\u200b Within this game, you are free to ponder deeply and fully imagine the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bIn a certain era, a resurrected spirit opens its eyes to observe the world.\u200b\u200b Beneath a gas-lit steel sky, you must choose your path, investigate the future, and calculate the city's causality with your mind. As shadows of fear devour the starry sky, \u200bevery turn of the road reshapes the throne's ownership\u2014and every truth uncovered ultimately points towards a fate you cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bThough presented from a single perspective, the game reveals the personalities and stories of other characters through multiple branches and intricate details, immersing you completely.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "(Eastern Fantasy \u00d7 Puzzle Narrative \u00d7 Multi-Ending Fate Choices) Uncover story layers through branching choices. Hidden enigmas unfold. Among countless deaths, one path survives. Perhaps revealed early, reaching it demands perseverance.",
